        {
          "id": "22b5de74-4b65-4cc0-9647-04dd8412a657",
          "name": "List comp sets",
          "request": {
            "name": "List comp sets",
            "description": {
              "content": "List the comp sets visible to the authenticated client.\n\n**Required scope:** `compsets:read`\n\n**Pagination:** `page[number]` and `page[size]`.\n\n**Filtering:** `filter[owner]=<user_id>`, `filter[listing]=<id>`,\n`filter[kind]=custom|connected`. `filter[owner]` is only meaningful for\nfull-access partner tokens; user-scoped tokens already see one user.\n\n**Sorting:** `sort=created-at` (default `-created-at`) or `sort=title`;\nprefix with `-` for descending.\n\n**Compound documents (sideloading):** Use the `include` query parameter\nto embed related resources (JSON:API compound documents). Supported:\n- `owner` - the user who owns the comp set\n- `listing` - the Beyond listing the comp set is anchored to (`null` for\n  `custom` comp sets)\n\n**Example:** `GET /api/v1/compsets/?include=owner,listing`\n\nEach entry is a lightweight summary (counts, title, `kind`, timestamps).\nFetch `GET /compsets/{id}/` for the full enriched comp set.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "compsets",
                ""
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "<string>,<string>",
                  "description": "[list of fields to sort by](https://jsonapi.org/format/#fetching-sorting)"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter[owner]",
                  "value": "<number>"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter[listing]",
                  "value": "<number>"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter[kind]",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "* `custom` - Custom\n* `connected` - Connected"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page[number]",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "A page number within the paginated result set."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page[size]",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "Number of results to return per page."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "include",
