          "name": "Get a comp set by id",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get a comp set by id",
            "description": {
              "content": "Return one comp set by id, fully enriched.\n\n**Required scope:** `compsets:read`\n\nReturns the comp set with members enriched across Airbnb, Vrbo, and\nBooking.com, the comp set's headline metrics over the next 30 and 90\ndays, and a `performance` block comparing the listing to the aggregated\ncompset benchmark over `start_date`..`end_date` (defaults: today →\ntoday+90d, max range 180 days).\n\nThe `kind` field distinguishes `custom` and `connected` comp sets; for\n`custom` comp sets some `source` fields and the main-listing\nperformance metrics are `null`.\n\nReturns **404** when no comp set with that id is visible to the client.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "compsets",
                ":compset_id",
                ""
